ttle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"怎么会…！","text_original":"そんな...！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"请停止抵抗！","text_original":"抵抗をやめてください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_defense_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"空仓待命！热，热恋白！","text_original":"ボルトキャッチ。テ、テルミットホワイト！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"魔力，装填完毕！","text_original":"マジカルパワー、装填完了！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"希望没有太引人注目……。","text_original":"人目につかないといいのですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_move_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"移动到下一个地点。","text_original":"次の場所へ移動します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_move_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"非常感谢你的治愈之光！","text_original":"治癒の光、ありがとうございます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_recovery_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"我…我还能行…!","text_original":"まだ…まだ行けます…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_retire.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"正在前进！","text_original":"進みます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"对我来说，只要能坚持正义……就足够作为报酬了。","text_original":"私にとっては、正義でありつづけること……それが報酬です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"原来……我还有着守护他人的力量。","text_original":"誰かを守れる力が……まだ私にもあったんですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里很和平呀……真是太好了。","text_original":"ここは平和ですね……とても良いことです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"（那边那位，难道是想向我搭话吗？）","text_original":"（あの方、もしかして話しかけようとしてくださっているのでは？）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"（得、得找些话题……想不到……明明昨晚好好考虑过的……！）","text_original":"（な、何か話題を……出てこない……昨晩、考えておいたのに……！）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"（果然应该先换身衣服再来吗……）","text_original":"（やはり、着替えてくるべきだったのでしょうか……）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"逃生路线已掌握完毕。","text_original":"避難経路は把握しています。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"向前方释放魔法！","text_original":"魔法を前方へ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_1","category":"event","text":"请、请不要扯它！这不是装饰品！","text_original":"ひ、引っ張ってはいけません！飾りではありません！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_2_1","category":"event","text":"6条顺时针魔法是，唔嗯……那个……。","text_original":"6条右回りの魔法は、うーん……えっと……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_2_2","category":"event","text":"不熟练的台词还有好多……很难记住。","text_original":"慣れないセリフが多く……覚えづらいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_3_1","category":"event","text":"呀！嘻、嘻！哈哈……！好痒呀……！","text_original":"きゃっ！ひ、ひゃはっ！ひゃぁっ……！くすぐったいです……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_3_2","category":"event","text":"我，我对挠痒痒真的没有抵抗力……！","text_original":"私、本当にくすぐられるのに弱くて……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_4_1","category":"event","text":"我很喜欢游乐园的气氛。","text_original":"遊園地の空気が、とても好きなんです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlobby_4_2","category":"event","text":"因为……非常和平。","text_original":"とても……平和なので。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlogin_1","category":"event","text":"一、一直盯着我看的话，我会紧张的……。","text_original":"そ、そんなに見つめられると、緊張します……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlogin_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlogin_2","category":"event","text":"这只是为了搜查才穿的。虽然这身衣服是挺可爱的啦……。","text_original":"あくまで捜査のために着ているだけです。可愛い衣装だとは思いますが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlogin_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlogin_season_1","category":"event","text":"观众好像越来越多了……。","text_original":"どんどん観客が増えているような……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlogin_season_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlogin_season_2","category":"event","text":"大家都很开心呢。无论形式如何，能帮上忙真是太好了。","text_original":"皆さん喜んでいますね。形は何であれ、お役に立てているようで良かったです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlogin_season_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlogin_season_end_1","category":"event","text":"对我自己正在做的事，渐渐能拥有自信了。谢谢您，老师。","text_original":"自分のやっていることに、ちゃんと自信を持てるようになりました。ありがとうございます、先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlogin_season_end_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventlogin_season_end_2","category":"event","text":"虽然潜入搜查结束了，但这之后的巡逻还会继续。今后也请您多多指教。","text_original":"潜入捜査は終わりましたが、これからもパトロールは続きます。今後ともよろしくお願いいたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventlogin_season_end_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_1","category":"event","text":"希望您能找到想要的东西。","text_original":"探しているものが見つかると良いのですが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_2","category":"event","text":"会让我想起在便利店的事呢。","text_original":"コンビニでのことを思い出しますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_buy_1","category":"event","text":"好的，是这个对吧。","text_original":"はい、こちらですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_buy_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_buy_2","category":"event","text":"好的，给您。","text_original":"はい、どうぞ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_buy_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_buy_3","category":"event","text":"感谢您一直以来的协助。","text_original":"いつも協力してくださりありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_buy_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_buy_4","category":"event","text":"希望能帮上老师的忙。","text_original":"先生のお役に立ちますよう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_buy_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_end","category":"event","text":"真是令人难忘的任务呢。非常感谢您。","text_original":"思い出に残る任務でしたね。ありがとうございました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_login_1","category":"event","text":"欢、欢迎光临。老师……。","text_original":"い、いらっしゃいませ。先生……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_eventshop_login_2","category":"event","text":"有您正在找的东西吗……？","text_original":"お探しのものはありますか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_eventshop_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"这、这个要怎么关掉呀！？","text_original":"こ、これどうやってオフにするんですか！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"要、要变身吗！？欸、欸咿！","text_original":"へ、変身するんですか！？え、えい！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"用友、友情！和爱！还、还有……火力！？","text_original":"ゆ、友情と！愛と！え、えっと……火力！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"向上投掷照明弹！","text_original":"照明弾を、真上へ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"闪耀吧！","text_original":"輝かせます！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"魔、魔法之光！","text_original":"ま、魔法の光を！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"呃……这些周边我自己觉得还挺可爱的……。不过真的适合我吗？","text_original":"ええと……こういうグッズ自体は可愛いと思いますが……。果たして、私に似合うのでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"是下一次的巡逻任务……吗。","text_original":"次のパトロール任務……ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"好……好的！请多指教！","text_original":"はっ……はい！よろしくお願いします！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"在这个高度的话，就能更顺利地进行观察了。","text_original":"この高さがあれば、観測がスムーズにできそうです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"这、这也是自警团任务的一部分……。为了圣三一和老师的安全，我会尽力的。","text_original":"こ、これも自警団任務の延長……です。トリニティと先生の安全のために、尽力いたします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"非、非常感谢您，老师……那个，一直盯着我看的话，会有点不好意思。","text_original":"あ、ありがとうございます、先生……その、あまり見られると、少し恥ずかしいのですが。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"感谢老师您一直守护着我所坚持的正义，我一直都心怀感激","text_original":"私なりの正義を見守ってくださり、ありがとうございます。いつも感謝しています。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"我一直都在寻求能够守护他人的力量。","text_original":"誰かを守り抜く力を、ずっと求めていたんです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"谢谢您，像这样一直照顾我。","text_original":"こうやって見守っていてくださり、ありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"怎、怎么样？这身衣服……不奇怪吧？","text_original":"ど、どうでしょうか？この衣装……変じゃないですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"不、不是那个意思。我不是为了听您夸奖才问的……！","text_original":"い、いえ。褒めてほしかったわけでは……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"自警团最近如何……吗。是的，目前一切顺利。","text_original":"自警団の近況……ですか。そうですね、今のところ順調です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊，那个……这一身并没有成为自警团的制服哦！","text_original":"あ、その……これが自警団の制服になったわけではありませんからね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"空仓待命！热恋白！","text_original":"ボルトキャッチ！テルミットホワイト！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"老、老师！？您何时来的！？","text_original":"せ、先生！？いつからそこに！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"为了研究，我有在看魔法少女相关的作品……。","text_original":"研究のために、魔法少女作品を見ているのですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"“只要火力足够高，那就会变成魔法”……看到了主张这样观点的作品，我觉得非常有意思。","text_original":"火力が高ければそれは魔法になる……という作品を見かけて、大変興味深かったです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"办公室的那面墙壁……是临时搭建的吧。","text_original":"執務室のあの壁……仮設のものですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"看起来适合用来进行穿透射击。","text_original":"貫通射撃を行うのにちょうどよさそうです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_login_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎回来，老师。我等您很久了。","text_original":"お帰りなさい、先生。お待ちしておりました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_login_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"感谢您叫我前来。我随时可以出动。","text_original":"お呼び出し、感謝します。いつでも出動できますよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_login_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"感谢您百忙之中抽空莅临。","text_original":"お忙しい中、お越しいただきありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_login_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"随时可以出发执行自警团任务。","text_original":"自警団任務、いつでもいけます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"老、老师！？您何时来的！？","text_original":"せ、先生！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"有、有什么要事吗！？话说，您是什么时候来的！","text_original":"な、なにかご用件でも！？というか、いつからいらしてたんですか！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"我太过沉浸在音乐里完全没有注意到……。","text_original":"音楽に集中していたので全然気づいておらず……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"不过，幸好来的是老师。","text_original":"でも、相手が先生で良かったです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"啊，这、这身衣服，是那个……！","text_original":"あっ、こ、この衣装は、その……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"是为了执行自警团的潜入搜查任务，所以才……。","text_original":"自警団の潜入捜査のため、でして……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_3_3","category":"lobby","text":"并、并不是我的个人趣味……！不是的！真的！","text_original":"わ、私の趣味というわけでは……！違います！本当に！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_3_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_4_1","category":"lobby","text":"我只是想事先确认一下尺寸合不合身才穿上的……！","text_original":"サイズが合うか事前に確認しようと思って着ただけで……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_4_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_4_2","category":"lobby","text":"（被、被说可爱了……）（突然被夸奖……呜呜……！）","text_original":"（か、可愛いと言ってくださりました……）（いきなり褒められると……うぅ……！）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_4_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_4_3","category":"lobby","text":"（被老师表扬，我还不太习惯。）（虽然很高兴……！但是……！）","text_original":"（褒められるのは、まだ慣れません。）（嬉しくはありますが……！でも……！）","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_4_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"今天看到的事情，要对其他人保密哦！","text_original":"今日見たことは、他の方には内緒にしてくださいね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"因为这是，机密事项……所以！","text_original":"これは、機密事項……なので！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikujipickup_1","category":"event","text":"是彩虹色呢。这是好东西吗？","text_original":"虹色ですね。これは良いものなのでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikujipickup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_1","category":"event","text":"总觉得能感受到周围的视线……。","text_original":"なんだか周囲からの視線を感じるのですが……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_2","category":"event","text":"在引起别人注意之前，快点抽卡吧……！","text_original":"人目を集めてしまう前に、早く引きましょう……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_end","category":"event","text":"已经到闭园时间了呢。确认一下有没有剩下的吧。","text_original":"もう閉園時間ですね。残った分がないか確かめてみましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_end.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_login_1_1","category":"event","text":"是老旧的机械呢。能正常运转吗……？","text_original":"古いマシンですね。ちゃんと動くのでしょうか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_login_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_login_1_2","category":"event","text":"把这个投进去好像就能启动了。","text_original":"これを投入すれば動くようです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_login_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_login_2_1","category":"event","text":"玲纱同学看起来玩得很开心，真是太好了。","text_original":"レイサさん、楽しんでいるみたいでよかったです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_login_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikuji_login_2_2","category":"event","text":"能抽到稀有度高？的卡片就好了。","text_original":"レア度が高い？カードが出るといいですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikuji_login_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikujipickup_2","category":"event","text":"是粉红色……呢。","text_original":"ピンク色……ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikujipickup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikujipickup_3","category":"event","text":"是金色呢。","text_original":"金色ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikujipickup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikujipickup_4","category":"event","text":"是水蓝色吗。很清爽的颜色呢。","text_original":"水色ですか。爽やかですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikujipickup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_omikujipickup_5","category":"event","text":"黑色……有点不吉利呀。","text_original":"黒……少し不吉ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_omikujipickup_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"谢谢您总是在陪伴在我身边。老师。","text_original":"いつも一緒にいてくださり、ありがとうございます。先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"您愿意依靠我……还有像这样特地来看我，我真的很开心。","text_original":"頼ってくださること……こうして会いに来てくださることを本当にうれしく思っております。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"幸福这东西，原来意外地近在身边呢。","text_original":"幸せとは、案外身近にあるものなのですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"如果您允许的话……从今往后，我想永远守护在老师身边。","text_original":"もし許されるのでしたら……これからもずっと、先生をお守りしたいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"我的生日，是吗？啊，原来是今天啊。","text_original":"私の誕生日、ですか？ああ、もうそんな日なのですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"我都没注意到。谢谢您为我庆祝生日。","text_original":"意識から抜け落ちていました。祝ってくださり、ありがとうございます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_3","category":"lobby","text":"您问我想要什么礼物吗？唔嗯……。","text_original":"ほしいプレゼント、ですか？うーん……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_4","category":"lobby","text":"没有什么特别想要的。因为我已经得到足够多了。","text_original":"特にないです。すでに十分、いただいていますから。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"祝您生日快乐。如果可以的话，要不要一起去散散步之类的？","text_original":"お誕生日おめでとうございます。よろしければ、一緒に散歩などいかがでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"欸，您说礼物的话想要……想、想听我说魔法少女的台词！？","text_original":"え、プレゼントに……ま、魔法少女のセリフを言ってほしい！？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_player_3","category":"lobby","text":"再、再怎么说，这也有些……！","text_original":"い、いくらなんでも、それは……っ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_player_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_birthday_player_4","category":"lobby","text":"呜、呜呜……魔法、心动……热恋白！……这样可以了吗？","text_original":"う、うぅ……まじかる、りりかる……てるみっとほわいと！……これでいいでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_birthday_player_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"来这里的路上，我从很多人那里收到了点心……","text_original":"ここまで来る間、多くの方からお菓子をいただいたのですが……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"还被叮嘱“不要恶作剧哦”……。","text_original":"いたずらをしないで、とも言われまして……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"难道，我看着这么像会搞恶作剧的人吗？","text_original":"そんなに、いたずらをする方だと思われているのでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_newyear_1","category":"lobby","text":"祝您新年快乐。今年也请多多指教。","text_original":"明けましておめでとうございます。今年もよろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_newyear_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_newyear_2","category":"lobby","text":"您问我新年的愿望，是吗……。","text_original":"新年の願い事、でしょうか……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_newyear_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_newyear_3","category":"lobby","text":"那么，我希望明年也能像这样和您互道问候，就很开心了。","text_original":"また来年も、こうやってご挨拶できると嬉しいです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_newyear_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"到了街上的人变多的时期了呢。那种兴奋雀跃的心情我也能理解。","text_original":"街に人が多くなる時期ですね。浮かれてしまう気持ちも分かります。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"能守护那份和平……并且也确实守护住了，我很开心。","text_original":"その平穏を守れること……守れていることを、嬉しく思います。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"可恶……是我的能力不足。","text_original":"ぐっ......私の不適応です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"……请求撤退。","text_original":"......退却を要請します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"魔法巡逻，现在开始！","text_original":"マジカルパトロール、開始します！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"现在开始执行任务……人、人太多了……！","text_original":"只今より任務を……ひ、人が多すぎる……！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"撤离完毕。继续执行任务。","text_original":"退避完了。任務を続行します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0325_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"已确保周围安全。老师，请指示。","text_original":"安全、確保しました。先生、指示を。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/ch0325_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0325_Title","category":"lobby","text":"蔚蓝档，档…...案。","text_original":"ブルーア、アーカイ……ブ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E5%AE%88%E6%9C%88%20%E9%93%83%E7%BE%8E/%E9%AD%94%E6%B3%95/jp/CH0325_Title.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[],"voice_kr":[],"gift_data":[{"id":1